      "message": "fix(post): smoothing is read from each operation's own setup\n\nThe per-op smoothing ask was gated on the ACTIVE setup's post options,\nwhile \"Skip pauses and homes\" (#389) is read from each op's own setup - so\nwith Setup1 smoothing and Setup2 not, posting with Setup1 active smoothed\nSetup2's ops too. Now read per op from op.setup, like skip_stops. Found\nby the delta review of #635 after main's per-setup post options landed.\n\nPinned by setup_post_options::smoothing_follows_each_ops_own_setup_not_the_active_one\n(fails on the old gate: both setups' pockets smooth with Setup1 active).\n\nRefs #616\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
